  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for Modgud resource servers. Validates\n      JWT access tokens, opaque reference tokens via introspection, or both\n      through one AddModgudResourceServer registration, then surfaces the per-audience\n      resource_access roles/permissions as flat claims so\n      [Authorize(Roles=\"...\")] and .RequireModgudPermission(\"...\") work\n      natively. Bypass tiers are pre-expanded by the IdP, so the lib does\n      pure exact-match — no evaluator logic.",
